    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d308-a11">

                <pb facs="0712" n="664" sameAs="frus:frus1868p1/pg664"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-02-13"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >February</hi> 13, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The Emperor having assumed to himself the treaty-making power, I have received
                    his mandate that all the engagements hitherto existing are to be observed. I
                    have been appointed chief administrator of foreign affairs, and Sanjo Saki No
                    Chinnagow, Hegashi Kuse Saki No Shosho, and Date Iyo No Kami, assist me. I beg
                    to communicate this for your information.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>YOSHIAKIRA NIHON SHUINO, <hi rendition="#italic">Prince of the blood,
                            second rank.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. B. Van Vankenburgh</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">American Minister.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
